# Twinblade Paladin: "Whenever you gain life, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." On turn 3 Bot1 has a 3/3 Paladin. Its first
# Healing Salve gives Bot2 3 life: not Bot1's gain, so no counter. Its second gives Bot1 3 life as one event, so exactly one counter
# (a 4/4), not three, and 23 life is under 25: no double strike (CR 603.2, 119.3).

